cartridge "MIDNIGHT MANOR/AMY BIENVENU/2026"

' MIDNIGHT MANOR - an original haunted house in 3D for the ColecoVision.
'
' An old music box lies in three pieces somewhere in the dark manor. Find
' them by lantern light, one at a time, and set each on the box's stand
' in the front hall. Doors creak open with the button (one is locked: find
' the key); stairs lead up and down. The lantern burns its oil, and the
' less there is, the less you see. A ghost drifts through the walls: if it
' touches you, you drop what you carry. Flash the lantern (the button,
' facing no door) to frighten it off - it costs oil. Three frights, or a
' dark lantern, and the night is over.
'
' Inspired by Atari's Haunted House (1981): the dark house, the stairs,
' the pieces to bring back, the locked door. Everything here is new: the
' 3D view, the manor, the music box, the art, the tune and the code.
'
' How it is drawn: a textured ray caster in the bitmap screen (engine.asm,
' tables.py): 32 rays a view, 4 pixels each, walls scaled from 16 x 16
' textures with a lit side and a dithered dark side, out of the lantern's
' reach black. The things in the house are sprites at four sizes, hidden
' behind nearer walls by each ray's distance.
'
' House rules: joystick and button only; text in columns 2-29, rows 1-22
' (drawn into the bitmap with font.py's letters); an original tune played
' once; the NMI is off outside the wait.

